      "user": {
        "title": "NUT server",
        "description": "Connect to upsd (the Network UPS Tools add-on is `a0d7b954-nut`). Username and password are the NUT user allowed to run commands (`instcmds`) and set variables (`actions: SET`); without them the integration is read-only.",
